      "High-Conversion B2B Marketing Page Design",
      "Mobile-First Responsive Layouts & RTL Readiness",
      "WCAG 2.1 AA Accessibility Compliance Audits"
    ],
    techStack: ["Figma", "Design Tokens", "Tailwind CSS", "Micro-Interactions", "WCAG AA"],
    idealFor: "Product teams needing high-converting, professional interfaces that developers can implement without friction."
